        "parent": "01M76AYSQCE68YTFVJQZANYNSD"
      },
      {
        "fields": {
          "question": "How is an official release cut? Today pushing a v* tag by hand publishes it; none has been cut yet (milestone 30 settled on v0.1.0 first).",
          "quote": "Let's chat about this one. We should have baked in release requirements. What triggers a release, etc.",
          "statement": "Release requirements are baked in: Rhiza decides by rule what triggers a release and which gates it must pass"
        },
        "handle": "m33-release-requirements",
        "id": "01M76AYSWKKGEWHC856D6W6VQP",
